    "font" : "CMR10",
    "font size" : 10.909,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "The modular Hamiltonian for multi-interval regions in d = 2 is known explicitly for free massless scalar and fermions [24, 25], and the local term agrees with (4.1)."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
