    "bounding box" : [ 72.0, 527.358, 523.281, 565.365 ],
    "font" : "CMR10",
    "font size" : 10.909,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "A clear operational definition of these entanglement temperatures is that they measure the ratio between the expectation value of the modular Hamiltonian and the energy for very localized high energy excitations:"
