    "bounding box" : [ 72.0, 459.271, 523.279, 484.002 ],
    "font" : "CMR10",
    "font size" : 10.909,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Here |ψ⟩ is an excitation above the vacuum localized in ∆x around the point x and has energy E. This limit can be argued to exist based on monotonicity of the relative entropy [9]."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
